#D001
#H
#C(168,005)|Heroes|
#G(384,030,032,030)016(016,053)
#F015
#L(048,050)|The Hero is one of the most important|
#L(048,070)|pieces in a game of Warlords.  Not only|
#L(016,090)|can it fight like a regular army, but it can|
#L(016,110)|seek out ruins in search of treasure.|
#F007
#L(016,135)|Each player receives one hero at the start of|
#L(016,155)|the game.  Others will offer to join you later,|
#L(016,175)|but only if you have enough gold to pay them.|
#F015
#L(016,200)|Your first hero always arrives by himself, but|
#L(016,220)|any others who join you later may bring allies,|
#L(016,240)|such as dragons and wizards, with them.|
#F007
#L(016,265)|All heroes are given a name, but you should feel|
#L(016,285)|free to rename them by clicking on their name|
#L(016,305)|and then typing a new one.|
#E

